<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Synthetic EN 16931:2017 invoice. It exists so that the round trip of UBL21RoundTripTest sees the
  business terms that the Peppol example corpus does not contain: BT-8, BT-15, BT-16, BT-17, BT-26,
  BT-87, BT-88, BT-114, BT-125 with BT-125-1 and BT-125-2, BT-128 with BT-128-1,
  BT-156 and BT-158-2. Every one of them would otherwise be untested by any round trip.
  BT-89 and BT-91 are in en16931-coverage-directdebit-invoice.xml instead, because CII-SR-467
  forbids more than one distinct payment means type code per document.
-->
